@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
title GitHub access — host selection, sandbox verification
' purpose: init chooses Git transport independently of API login; run reports credential inventory
' covers: internal/githubaccess/access.go, internal/githubaccess/access_test.go
' covers: cmd/proveo/init_github_access.go, cmd/proveo/init_github_access_test.go
' covers: internal/run/credential_inventory.go, internal/run/choices.go
' covers: internal/run/credential_inventory_test.go
' covers: internal/backend/sandbox/github_access_test.go
' covers: internal/choiceui/credential_lists_test.go
' covers: internal/contract/github_access_test.go
' covers: e2e/init_github_access_test.go
' Accepted proposal: _spec/_plans/init-github-access.puml
' API token storage: _spec/cmd/proveo/github-credentials.puml
' Runtime capability: https://docs.docker.com/ai/sandboxes/configuration/credentials/#ssh-agent
' Upstream regression: https://github.com/docker/sbx-releases/issues/835
'
' INIT
' Setup retains three numbered pages. GitHub now runs the existing API-token
' stage and then a contextual access panel. API failure does not prevent the
' operator choosing SSH. gh owns login; proveo does not change gh's protocol.
' The panel shows host API identity, protocol, exposed SSH fingerprints and
' sandbox verification pending. The initial choice follows gh's github.com
' protocol unless a previous explicit choice exists.
' SSH agent / HTTPS token / later are independent of trust repo.
' SSH requires readable forwarding settings and a reachable host agent with
' keys. A configured sbx ssh.agentSocketPath wins over client SSH_AUTH_SOCK.
' An unset fixed socket stays unset; init never pins a transient socket.
' Repair offers retry / HTTPS / later. Disabled forwarding also offers an
' explicit enable + restart action describing its host-wide daemon impact.
' Keys stay in the host agent. Public keys must already be registered at GitHub.
' init never copies private keys, creates a key, or tests by creating a commit.
' --yes and non-TTY report host readiness without a new transport grant.
' WHAT INIT PRINTS (R3, 2026-11-11): one "access" fact in the "git" block
' (_spec/cmd/proveo/init-sbx-bootstrap.puml, WHAT INIT PRINTS). A saved choice
' reads "access: ssh" with its github.json path dim (~/…). Unprompted it reads
' the saved choice or "not chosen", dim "N host key(s); sandbox verification
' pending" and the SSH problem's state, cut before its ";" ("host agent
' unavailable or empty", without "load … with ssh-add"); with no terminal one
' more dim line, "`proveo init` from a terminal signs in and chooses it";
' --yes keeps no how-to. Pinned by cmd/proveo/init_github_access_test.go
' TestAnUnaskedAccessKeepsSSHsStateAndAHowToOnlyWithoutATerminal.
' Gone: "sandbox Git: <mode> — <abs path>", "host configured; proveo run
' verifies sandbox SSH before releasing the agent" (what a later command
' does), "run proveo init from a terminal to choose access" under --yes.
' Failures are ⚠ items in the same block; a Ctrl+C that ends `sbx settings
' set` or `sbx daemon restart` stops init.
' The choice persists atomically as transport only, in the host user-config
' directory's proveo/github.json. Unknown or malformed choices fail a run.
'
' RUN
' A missing choice retains the existing HTTPS behavior.
' SSH adds required runtime com.docker.sandbox/ssh-agent@1 and declares
' SSH_AUTH_SOCK in startup-hook env. HTTPS and later add no SSH capability.
' A changed descriptor follows the existing receipt-based recreation path.
' HTTPS sets command-environment Git URL rewrites for github.com's two
' standard SSH URL forms. Stored remotes and host gh configuration stay intact.
' Repository safety and URL rewrites share one GIT_CONFIG_COUNT environment.
' SSH leaves native Git transport intact; later adds no transport adaptation.
' The Stop hook uses the same choice. Legacy empty mode retains HTTPS.
' Seed installs trusted GitHub host keys, checks a real agent socket and keys,
' then checks GitHub's successful SSH greeting with exit code 1.
' SSH checks have deadlines. The seed refusal prevents agent launch on failure.
' An instruction-wait timeout also refuses SSH-mode launch before seed release.
' Where origin has a standard GitHub SSH push URL, ls-remote checks read access
' at that destination. It never claims branch write permission or test-pushes.
' API and SSH identities remain distinct. A failed check names recovery through init.
'
' CREDENTIAL INVENTORY
' Execution order: OS, trust repo, credentials, optional ports/apps.
' credentials: disabled [x] API keys v [x] OAuth v [x] SSH v.
' Tick only nonempty classes; an empty class has no arrow.
' This is host inventory, not a promise that the selected model uses each item.
' API/OAuth entries use service names from sbx metadata and present credential
' variable names, deduplicated. SSH entries show host-agent public fingerprints.
' No token or private key value is displayed. The row is never read as a mode.
' Each populated cell opens its complete read-only list with the ports dropdown
' mechanism. Left/right changes the list; up/down moves inside it; space cannot
' mutate credentials. Lists scroll to the highlighted entry on short terminals.
' AMENDED 2026-11-13 (owner, O7 and O4): credentials is the run form's first
' row, under "agent", above model. It gains a fourth class, ".env": the
' names the run's env file sets, names only, filterable with "/". Each list
' is a small card; its entries carry their own help. The order and the
' layout: _spec/internal/choiceui/wireframe.puml (ONE CARD).
' Topology always puts the credential marker at the broker, including local
' models, OAuth and disabled legacy-forward/host previews.

rectangle "proveo init\nGitHub now / later" as INIT
rectangle "API login\nsbx github service" as API
rectangle "Transport panel\nSSH / HTTPS / later" as PANEL
database "Host user config\nproveo/github.json" as CONFIG
rectangle "proveo run\ncredential inventory" as RUN
rectangle "Runtime SSH capability\nagent socket + GitHub check" as SSH
rectangle "HTTPS Git environment\nsbx credential proxy" as HTTPS
rectangle "Agent + Stop hook\nselected transport" as AGENT

INIT --> API
INIT --> PANEL
PANEL --> CONFIG
CONFIG --> RUN
RUN --> SSH : ssh
RUN --> HTTPS : https
SSH --> AGENT : verified
HTTPS --> AGENT
RUN --> AGENT : later
@enduml
